# Reaches Rebel's `printing`, so that `heroes test` on this file runs the
# package's tests (spec § 12). It prints how many printers this machine knows,
# or the code it fails with where the machine has no print system.

use <rebel>/printing

function main()
    match printing.printers()
        .ok found => print(found.len())
        .err e    => print(e.code)
